{
  "watching": {
    "start": "00:10:27,845",
    "end": "00:22:12,983"
  },
  "fullSubtitles": [
    {
      "start": "00:10:27,845",
      "end": "00:10:30,381",
      "text": "I just thought she'd at least see we deserved a shot."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:30,415",
      "end": "00:10:33,217",
      "text": "Never mind what this person you don't even know said."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:33,251",
      "end": "00:10:35,353",
      "text": "Do you think you're good enough?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:35,386",
      "end": "00:10:36,821",
      "text": "- Of course, but... - Then you must fight"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:36,854",
      "end": "00:10:37,955",
      "text": "for what you believe in."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:37,989",
      "end": "00:10:40,224",
      "text": "Guts, stamina, faith."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:40,258",
      "end": "00:10:42,226",
      "text": "These are the things you need now,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:42,260",
      "end": "00:10:44,395",
      "text": "and without them..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:44,429",
      "end": "00:10:46,731",
      "text": "Well, maybe that scout was right."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:46,764",
      "end": "00:10:49,667",
      "text": "Maybe you're not good enough."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:19,030",
      "end": "00:11:20,798",
      "text": "♪ Ah ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:23,634",
      "end": "00:11:25,703",
      "text": "♪ Oh ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:27,538",
      "end": "00:11:28,606",
      "text": "♪ Ah ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:30,675",
      "end": "00:11:32,510",
      "text": "♪ Oh... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:33,511",
      "end": "00:11:35,847",
      "text": "Oh, I... No, I know, Rosita, but trust me on this."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:35,880",
      "end": "00:11:37,448",
      "text": "It'll be totally worth it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:37,482",
      "end": "00:11:38,883",
      "text": "And listen, I'm outside her place now,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:38,916",
      "end": "00:11:40,052",
      "text": "so can you call the others"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:40,085",
      "end": "00:11:41,953",
      "text": "and have 'em meet up in half an hour?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:41,986",
      "end": "00:11:43,921",
      "text": "Great. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:47,425",
      "end": "00:11:49,627",
      "text": "♪ Off, off with your head ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:50,962",
      "end": "00:11:53,531",
      "text": "♪ Dance, dance till you're dead ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:54,732",
      "end": "00:11:56,501",
      "text": "- ♪ Heads will roll ♪ - ♪ Heads will roll ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:56,534",
      "end": "00:11:58,402",
      "text": "♪ Heads will roll ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:58,436",
      "end": "00:11:59,871",
      "text": "- ♪ Heads will roll ♪ - ♪ Heads will roll ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:11:59,904",
      "end": "00:12:01,038",
      "text": "♪ On the floor ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:01,073",
      "end": "00:12:03,841",
      "text": "♪ Off, off, off with your head ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:03,875",
      "end": "00:12:05,910",
      "text": "♪ Dance, dance ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:05,943",
      "end": "00:12:08,479",
      "text": "♪ Dance till you're dead, dead ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:08,513",
      "end": "00:12:12,316",
      "text": "♪ Off, off, off with your head ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:12,350",
      "end": "00:12:15,787",
      "text": "♪ Dance, dance, dance till you're dead. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:18,123",
      "end": "00:12:19,857",
      "text": "Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:19,891",
      "end": "00:12:21,425",
      "text": "Good night."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:23,895",
      "end": "00:12:25,563",
      "text": "Moon. Hey."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:26,831",
      "end": "00:12:28,666",
      "text": "Wow. You were great out there."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:28,699",
      "end": "00:12:30,535",
      "text": "I got to go back out for an encore."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:30,568",
      "end": "00:12:31,969",
      "text": "Okay. Hey, but what are you doing"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:32,003",
      "end": "00:12:33,604",
      "text": "- after the show? - Uh, nothing."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:33,638",
      "end": "00:12:35,406",
      "text": "Well, listen, I know this is crazy short notice,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:35,439",
      "end": "00:12:37,075",
      "text": "but you always said you'd come back to work with us"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:37,109",
      "end": "00:12:39,077",
      "text": "- when the time was right. - Of course."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:39,111",
      "end": "00:12:41,579",
      "text": "Well, this is that time."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:41,612",
      "end": "00:12:43,081",
      "text": "Here, paycheck."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:43,115",
      "end": "00:12:44,682",
      "text": "I'm getting the gang together to go audition"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:44,715",
      "end": "00:12:46,384",
      "text": "- for this huge show... - Just-just a second."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:46,417",
      "end": "00:12:48,820",
      "text": "Hey, Rick, how come you're only paying me"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:48,853",
      "end": "00:12:50,588",
      "text": "half what the other acts get?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:50,621",
      "end": "00:12:52,890",
      "text": "I pay what I think you're worth, sweetheart."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:52,924",
      "end": "00:12:54,659",
      "text": "Oh, okay. See, I have this rule"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:54,692",
      "end": "00:12:57,962",
      "text": "about not letting guys like you tell me what I'm worth,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:57,995",
      "end": "00:12:59,764",
      "text": "so, you know, unless I get paid"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:12:59,797",
      "end": "00:13:01,766",
      "text": "like everyone else, I'm out of here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:01,799",
      "end": "00:13:03,835",
      "text": "This is the only club in town."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:03,868",
      "end": "00:13:05,103",
      "text": "Where else you gonna play?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:05,137",
      "end": "00:13:07,038",
      "text": "I have no idea, but I'm sure as heck"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:07,072",
      "end": "00:13:08,573",
      "text": "not sticking around here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:08,606",
      "end": "00:13:09,707",
      "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:09,740",
      "end": "00:13:11,442",
      "text": "Ooh!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:11,475",
      "end": "00:13:13,911",
      "text": "Whoa, whoa. Wait a minute. You-you got to do the encore."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:13,945",
      "end": "00:13:15,947",
      "text": "Hey, Ash!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:15,980",
      "end": "00:13:17,982",
      "text": "Deal with it, sweetheart."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:18,015",
      "end": "00:13:19,984",
      "text": "Redshore City Bus five"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:20,017",
      "end": "00:13:22,420",
      "text": "leaving from park 15..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:22,453",
      "end": "00:13:24,755",
      "text": "Okay, I got the tickets."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:24,789",
      "end": "00:13:25,990",
      "text": "Anyone seen Miss Crawly?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:26,023",
      "end": "00:13:27,391",
      "text": "Here you go, Johnny."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:27,425",
      "end": "00:13:28,693",
      "text": "- Here's yours, and... - Mr. Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:28,726",
      "end": "00:13:30,862",
      "text": "Uh, uh, I'm sorry, but I'm really having"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:30,895",
      "end": "00:13:32,463",
      "text": "second thoughts about this."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:32,496",
      "end": "00:13:34,632",
      "text": "What? No, no, no, wait."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:34,665",
      "end": "00:13:36,500",
      "text": "All right, last call. Let's go."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:36,534",
      "end": "00:13:38,502",
      "text": "- Now, just a second. - Johnny's right."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:38,536",
      "end": "00:13:40,172",
      "text": "I mean, that theater scout,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:40,205",
      "end": "00:13:41,906",
      "text": "she didn't think we were good enough."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:41,939",
      "end": "00:13:44,142",
      "text": "- She sounds like a jerk. - Yeah, total jerk."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:44,176",
      "end": "00:13:46,410",
      "text": "Yeah, but she's wrong... dead wrong."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:46,444",
      "end": "00:13:49,480",
      "text": "There's a reason our show is sold out every night,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:49,513",
      "end": "00:13:51,449",
      "text": "and I'm telling you, her boss is gonna love it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:51,482",
      "end": "00:13:53,151",
      "text": "Ooh. Or maybe we could just, like,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:53,185",
      "end": "00:13:55,019",
      "text": "do a different show, you know?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:55,053",
      "end": "00:13:56,721",
      "text": "Gunter, please, I got this."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:56,754",
      "end": "00:13:59,957",
      "text": "Seriously, I have this idea for, like, a space musical."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:13:59,991",
      "end": "00:14:02,894",
      "text": "All right, we're rolling out here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:02,927",
      "end": "00:14:05,097",
      "text": "You don't want to hear about the space musical?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:05,130",
      "end": "00:14:07,732",
      "text": "Guys, come on!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:07,765",
      "end": "00:14:09,567",
      "text": "Wait!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:18,009",
      "end": "00:14:20,745",
      "text": "Listen, you guys, I have dreamt of performing"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:20,778",
      "end": "00:14:23,714",
      "text": "in Redshore City since I was a little kid."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:23,748",
      "end": "00:14:25,683",
      "text": "And besides, I just convinced my husband"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:25,716",
      "end": "00:14:27,718",
      "text": "to babysit for the next 24 hours,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:27,752",
      "end": "00:14:30,655",
      "text": "and I am not gonna waste an opportunity like that."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:30,688",
      "end": "00:14:33,958",
      "text": "So come on. We've got nothing to lose."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:35,860",
      "end": "00:14:37,229",
      "text": "Here, Ash."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:37,262",
      "end": "00:14:38,796",
      "text": "You come in on page two."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:38,829",
      "end": "00:14:40,698",
      "text": "Wait. We're just gonna rehearse this here"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:40,731",
      "end": "00:14:42,700",
      "text": "- at the back of the bus? - Yes, we are."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:42,733",
      "end": "00:14:44,236",
      "text": "- Course we are. - Yep."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:44,269",
      "end": "00:14:46,604",
      "text": "We got to get this show in the best shape ever."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:46,637",
      "end": "00:14:48,806",
      "text": "Ah, Miss Crawly, you made it. Good."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:48,839",
      "end": "00:14:51,209",
      "text": "You are an angel, and we're sure gonna need that..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:51,243",
      "end": "00:14:53,044",
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:53,078",
      "end": "00:14:54,545",
      "text": "What the..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:54,578",
      "end": "00:14:59,184",
      "text": "Uh, well, you did say, \"Dress to impress.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:14:59,217",
      "end": "00:15:01,485",
      "text": "♪ Time ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:04,622",
      "end": "00:15:08,793",
      "text": "♪ All the long red lines ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:11,595",
      "end": "00:15:14,532",
      "text": "♪ That take control ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:17,868",
      "end": "00:15:22,506",
      "text": "♪ Of all the smoke like streams ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:24,276",
      "end": "00:15:28,479",
      "text": "♪ That flow into your dreams ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:31,149",
      "end": "00:15:35,753",
      "text": "♪ That big blue open sea ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:38,756",
      "end": "00:15:41,759",
      "text": "♪ That can't be crossed ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:44,762",
      "end": "00:15:49,101",
      "text": "♪ That can't be climbed ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:51,769",
      "end": "00:15:53,571",
      "text": "♪ Just born between... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:53,604",
      "end": "00:15:55,006",
      "text": "Absolutely right. Let's just cut that line"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:55,039",
      "end": "00:15:56,208",
      "text": "and have you just play"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:56,241",
      "end": "00:15:57,575",
      "text": "the guitar part through the whole scene."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:15:57,608",
      "end": "00:16:00,145",
      "text": "- Got it. - Guys, we're here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:29,673",
      "end": "00:16:33,311",
      "text": "All right. Let's go spread a little Moon Theater magic."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:34,745",
      "end": "00:16:36,914",
      "text": "- Woo-hoo! - Come on!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:40,085",
      "end": "00:16:41,053",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:41,086",
      "end": "00:16:42,686",
      "text": "No? What do you mean, \"no\"?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:42,720",
      "end": "00:16:45,656",
      "text": "For the last time, sir, no appointment, no entry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:45,689",
      "end": "00:16:47,292",
      "text": "- Um... - Sir, do I need to call security?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:47,325",
      "end": "00:16:48,793",
      "text": "We should go."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:48,826",
      "end": "00:16:50,328",
      "text": "Yes, you should. Next, please."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:50,362",
      "end": "00:16:51,796",
      "text": "I don't like this."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:51,829",
      "end": "00:16:53,198",
      "text": "Hi. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:53,231",
      "end": "00:16:55,200",
      "text": "I'm here to see Mr. Crystal for the presentation."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:55,233",
      "end": "00:16:56,667",
      "text": "This is so unfair."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:56,700",
      "end": "00:16:58,236",
      "text": "She's, like, totally unfair, that lady."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:16:58,270",
      "end": "00:17:00,805",
      "text": "I mean, why's she got to be so snotty about it?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:00,838",
      "end": "00:17:02,873",
      "text": "I got all dressed up for nothing."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:02,907",
      "end": "00:17:04,642",
      "text": "Let's just find somewhere for lunch"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:04,675",
      "end": "00:17:05,810",
      "text": "- and hang out. - Everyone, in here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:05,843",
      "end": "00:17:08,712",
      "text": "Quick. Get in."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:10,881",
      "end": "00:17:11,615",
      "text": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:11,649",
      "end": "00:17:13,085",
      "text": "- Oh, come on. - So dark in here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:13,118",
      "end": "00:17:14,952",
      "text": "- What's going on? - Shh! I got to think."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:14,985",
      "end": "00:17:16,687",
      "text": "- I've got to think. I've got to think. - Mr. Moon?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:16,720",
      "end": "00:17:18,223",
      "text": "- I've got to think. - I'm not so good in small spaces."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:18,256",
      "end": "00:17:19,890",
      "text": "- Okay, okay, okay. - Ow! Somebody stepped on my trotter."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:19,924",
      "end": "00:17:21,826",
      "text": "- Sorry. Sorry. - Okay, honey. Come on."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:21,859",
      "end": "00:17:23,694",
      "text": "- Let's get you out of here. - Aha!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:23,727",
      "end": "00:17:24,929",
      "text": "Look at this."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:24,962",
      "end": "00:17:25,796",
      "text": "Meena."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:25,830",
      "end": "00:17:28,766",
      "text": "Do you think that's kind of your size?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:35,906",
      "end": "00:17:39,111",
      "text": "♪ White shirt now red, my bloody nose ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:39,144",
      "end": "00:17:42,780",
      "text": "♪ Sleepin', you're on your tippy-toes ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:42,813",
      "end": "00:17:45,749",
      "text": "♪ Creepin' around like no one knows ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:45,783",
      "end": "00:17:47,219",
      "text": "♪ Think you're... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:47,252",
      "end": "00:17:49,087",
      "text": "Hey, Ricky."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:17:50,288",
      "end": "00:17:52,656",
